- Okay. Nice to meet you.

240
00:14:41,589 --> 00:14:43,591
- Uh, my job is a fighter.
- [Hikaru] Ooh.

241
00:14:43,674 --> 00:14:45,175
MA-KUN (28)
GUNMA - MMA FIGHTER

242
